00:32:15.640 --> 00:32:16.640
He cannot shut up.
他一直在大声喊着建议。

783
00:32:16.780 --> 00:32:18.460
He keeps yelling suggestions.
为了准备这次录制，我前几天又重温了一遍。

784
00:32:18.840 --> 00:32:21.480
I did rewatch this the other day in preparation for this.
但是，没错，他一直在。

785
00:32:21.820 --> 00:32:22.540
But, yeah, he keeps.
等等，让我们听听看。

786
00:32:22.720 --> 00:32:23.700
Wait, let's hear it.
能放一下那段吗？

787
00:32:23.800 --> 00:32:24.540
Can we play that?
好的。

788
00:32:25.140 --> 00:32:25.420
Okay.
接下来的练习，大家两两分组。

789
00:32:25.760 --> 00:32:27.580
For the next exercise, let's everyone pair up.
找个搭档。

790
00:32:31.200 --> 00:32:31.560
Partner.
大家都找到人了吗？

791
00:32:34.400 --> 00:32:35.520
And everybody got somebody?
嗯。

792
00:32:35.720 --> 00:32:36.000
Uh-huh.
好，很好。

793
00:32:36.560 --> 00:32:37.040
Okay, good.
好的。

794
00:32:39.580 --> 00:32:39.940
Okay.
你为什么不去走廊里，在脑子里把那些规则过一遍呢？

795
00:32:41.340 --> 00:32:44.220
Why don't you go in the hallway and just go through all those rules in your head?
我就在这儿观察。

796
00:32:44.240 --> 00:32:44.960
I'll just observe over here.
好的。

797
00:32:45.300 --> 00:32:45.660
Okay.
但别。

798
00:32:45.840 --> 00:32:46.280
But don't.
好吧，你休息一下，稍微。

799
00:32:46.480 --> 00:32:47.900
Okay, you take a break and just sort of.
在脑子里把规则过一遍。

800
00:32:48.660 --> 00:32:49.600
Run through the rules in your head.
在脑子里把规则过一遍。

801
00:32:49.720 --> 00:32:50.400
Okay, stay there.
好了，待在那儿别动。

802
00:32:51.040 --> 00:32:52.400
I'll just throw in some suggestions.
我来提几个建议。

803
00:32:53.440 --> 00:32:54.340
Okay, you guys want to start?
好了，你们想开始了吗？

804
00:32:56.080 --> 00:32:57.300
Don't throw in any suggestions.
别提什么建议了。

805
00:32:57.520 --> 00:32:57.570
We're in a whorehouse.
我们在一家妓院里。

806
00:32:57.570 --> 00:32:58.800
Okay, we don't need a suggestion for this.
好了，这个不需要什么建议。

807
00:32:59.040 --> 00:32:59.440
And he's a proctologiSt.
而且他是个肛肠科医生。

808
00:32:59.440 --> 00:33:00.600
Okay, this one's going to come from them.
好了，这个得由他们来提。

809
00:33:00.720 --> 00:33:01.640
This one's going to come from them.
这个得由他们来提。

810
00:33:02.320 --> 00:33:06.600
It's getting called Yes, And, and you will say the first sentence.
这个游戏叫“是的，而且”，你要说出第一句话。

811
00:33:08.800 --> 00:33:10.520
First sentence is, I am a proctologiSt.
第一句话是：我是一名肛肠科医生。

812
00:33:11.140 --> 00:33:12.440
We're not going to get a suggestion on this one.
我们这个不需要建议。

813
00:33:12.540 --> 00:33:13.180
It's going to come from them.
得由他们来提。

814
00:33:13.180 --> 00:33:17.600
Okay, you're going to say the first sentence, and then she will say yes to that, and then
好了，你来说第一句，然后她会表示赞同，接着

815
00:33:17.600 --> 00:33:20.080
she'll add something to the story, like you're telling the story.
她会给故事加点料，就像你在讲故事一样。

816
00:33:22.820 --> 00:33:23.340
What were you?
你刚才是什么身份？

817
00:33:23.520 --> 00:33:23.980
What was he doing?
他在做什么？

818
00:33:26.600 --> 00:33:26.920
Okay.
好吧。

819
00:33:28.040 --> 00:33:29.000
Why don't you take a break?
你为什么不休息一下？

820
00:33:29.340 --> 00:33:30.220
Since you don't have a partner.
反正你也没有搭档。

821
00:33:30.420 --> 00:33:31.060
All right, I'm right here.
好吧，我就在这儿。

822
00:33:33.960 --> 00:33:34.280
Okay.
好吧。

823
00:33:35.100 --> 00:33:36.820
They just let the camera roll.
他们就让摄像机一直开着。

824
00:33:37.200 --> 00:33:38.540
I went and checked the script.
我特意去查了剧本。

825
00:33:38.660 --> 00:33:39.440
It wasn't scripted.
那段没写在剧本里。

826
00:33:39.520 --> 00:33:44.560
So I really felt like there were some loose elements to this sort of these improv scenes.
所以我真的觉得这些即兴表演场景里有些松散的元素。

827
00:33:44.700 --> 00:33:47.660
But yeah, he keeps trying to make suggestions, and they're horrible.
但没错，他一直在试图提建议，而且都很糟糕。

828
00:33:48.160 --> 00:33:49.820
And you're just, you're looking at him.
而你只是看着他。

829
00:33:49.820 --> 00:33:51.440
Yeah, proctologist is just the most basic.
没错，肛肠科医生是最基础的设定。

830
00:33:51.780 --> 00:33:52.620
Yeah, at a whorehouse.
没错，还在妓院里。

831
00:33:53.120 --> 00:33:54.220
Oh, is that what he said?
噢，他是这么说的吗？

832
00:33:54.220 --> 00:33:56.720
Yes, you're at a whorehouse, and you're a proctologiSt.
是的，你在妓院里，而且你是个肛肠科医生。

833
00:33:57.760 --> 00:33:59.660
Then you're like, no more suggestions.
然后你就说，别再提建议了。

834
00:33:59.920 --> 00:34:00.140
That's a good setup.
那是个不错的设定。

835
00:34:00.140 --> 00:34:05.180
And your back is to him, he's behind you, and you face the two people who are starting
你的背对着他，他在你身后，你面对着那两个开始

836
00:34:05.180 --> 00:34:09.680
the scene, and then he's like whispering behind you, and you're like, stop it.
表演的人，然后他在你身后嘀咕，你就说，别闹了。

837
00:34:09.860 --> 00:34:12.380
But I could not have gotten through those.
但我当时真的快撑不下去了。

838
00:34:12.480 --> 00:34:15.480
And you can see people kind of trying not to break.
你可以看到大家都在努力憋笑。

839
00:34:16.100 --> 00:34:20.240
I was just like, I had to ask you, what was it like to be in those scenes with Steve?
我当时就想，我必须问问你，和史蒂夫一起演那些戏是什么感觉？

840
00:34:20.240 --> 00:34:24.540
Because he himself is such a great improviser, and that was all off script.
因为他本人就是个即兴表演高手，而且那些全都是临场发挥的。

841
00:34:25.560 --> 00:34:29.120
You know, I feel like at the Groundlings, I could be a breaker.
你知道，我觉得在“地基剧团”时，我可能会忍不住笑场。

842
00:34:29.680 --> 00:34:31.720
You know, and some people hate that.
你知道，有些人很讨厌那样。

843
00:34:31.920 --> 00:34:35.400
Like, you know, you see people breaking, like, just stay in the scene, stay in character.
就像你看到有人笑场，就会想，保持住，别出戏。

844
00:34:36.360 --> 00:34:37.520
And I was guilty of that.
我也犯过这种错。

845
00:34:37.600 --> 00:34:42.320
But I feel like when, if I'm on a show, and I'm just there for a day, I don't know if
但我觉得，如果我是在某个节目里客串一天，我不知道是因为紧张

846
00:34:42.320 --> 00:34:44.380
you're nervous or just like, I just want to do everything right.
还是因为只想把一切做好。

847
00:34:44.660 --> 00:34:48.700
So I don't remember feeling tempted to break, no matter how funny it was.
所以我记得我没有想笑场的冲动，不管当时有多好笑。

848
00:34:48.840 --> 00:34:50.200
I was just like, I'm gonna do my job.
我当时就想，我要做好我的工作。

849
00:34:50.340 --> 00:34:50.980
I'm gonna stay in character.
我要保持住角色。

850
00:34:52.240 --> 00:34:54.020
But that was, I don't know, my mindset.
但这就是，我不知道，我的心态吧。

851
00:34:54.220 --> 00:34:54.780
That's amazing.
那太棒了。

852
00:34:54.960 --> 00:34:56.920
I was like, I'm not gonna break.
我当时心想，我绝不能笑场。

853
00:34:56.920 --> 00:35:00.800
Like, my memory was that, like, finally, maybe Steve would break.
我的记忆是，也许史蒂夫最终会笑场。

854
00:35:01.380 --> 00:35:04.940
Or maybe someone off, like a producer or someone would break.
或者制片人什么的会笑场。

855
00:35:05.120 --> 00:35:05.700
Then you could laugh.
那样你就能笑了。

856
00:35:05.820 --> 00:35:07.820
Then you gave the room permission to laugh.
那样你就给了全场人笑场的许可。

857
00:35:08.080 --> 00:35:08.300
Yeah.
没错。

858
00:35:08.480 --> 00:35:11.240
But I'm like, I'm not gonna ruin this take, because I don't know what they're gonna use.
但我心想，我不能毁了这一条，因为我不知道他们会用哪一段。

859
00:35:11.560 --> 00:35:13.380
And they're just like, I didn't know.
他们当时就说，我不知道。

860
00:35:14.000 --> 00:35:17.820
Like, the scripted dialogue ends, and then I'm kind of going, oh, we're still going?
剧本对话结束了，我还在想，哦，还在拍吗？

861
00:35:18.040 --> 00:35:18.280
Yeah.
是啊。

862
00:35:18.280 --> 00:35:19.460
I guess they didn't call.
我想他们没喊停。

863
00:35:19.620 --> 00:35:20.200
Okay, what's happening?
好吧，发生什么了？

864
00:35:20.200 --> 00:35:20.600
They didn't call cut.
他们没喊停。

865
00:35:20.600 --> 00:35:22.780
So that's exactly what happened in this scene.
所以这一幕里发生的就是这种情况。

866
00:35:23.000 --> 00:35:26.580
I think you can see where the script would have ended, and they just let you guys keep
我想你能看出剧本本该在哪里结束，但他们只是让你们继续

867
00:35:26.580 --> 00:35:27.000
going.
演下去。

868
00:35:27.920 --> 00:35:28.360
And...
然后……

869
00:35:28.360 --> 00:35:29.700
But I was not gonna be the one to stop.
但我绝不会是那个喊停的人。

870
00:35:29.700 --> 00:35:30.760
You did not break.
你确实没笑场。

871
00:35:30.940 --> 00:35:31.320
No.
没有。

872
00:35:31.620 --> 00:35:36.540
So there was one scene, though, where I felt like I saw people starting to break just a
不过有一场戏，我觉得我看到大家开始有一点点

873
00:35:36.540 --> 00:35:36.780
little.
要笑场了。

874
00:35:37.080 --> 00:35:39.500
And it is when you...
就是当你……

875
00:35:39.500 --> 00:35:40.420
It's so funny.
太搞笑了。

876
00:35:41.040 --> 00:35:43.380
Michael keeps killing everyone in all his scenes.
迈克尔在所有戏里都在把大家逗笑。

877
00:35:43.800 --> 00:35:47.040
And so you turn to him, and you say, give me all the guns.
然后你转向他，说，把所有的枪都给我。

878
00:35:47.260 --> 00:35:47.660
Right.
没错。

879
00:35:47.660 --> 00:35:48.000
And they're all...
他们全都是……

880
00:35:48.000 --> 00:35:48.720
And they're juSt...
他们只是……

881
00:35:48.720 --> 00:35:49.320
They're air.
那是空气枪。

882
00:35:49.540 --> 00:35:51.080
You know, he's just handing you his improv.
你知道，他只是在给你即兴表演。

883
00:35:51.080 --> 00:35:51.980
Right, but he knows where they are.
没错，但他知道枪在哪。

884
00:35:51.980 --> 00:35:53.780
Yeah, and he takes them out of all his pockets.
是啊，他从所有的口袋里把它们掏出来。

885
00:35:54.120 --> 00:35:54.460
Yeah, yeah.
没错，没错。

886
00:35:54.580 --> 00:35:55.720
And then you're like, fine.
然后你说，好吧。

887
00:35:55.940 --> 00:36:00.300
And now the next scene is Michael and Ken's character.
下一场戏是迈克尔和肯的角色。

888
00:36:00.620 --> 00:36:01.900
And he's like, freeze!
他说，不许动！

889
00:36:02.140 --> 00:36:06.320
And like, Ken Jeong has his hands up, and then Michael whispers something in his ear.
肯·郑举起双手，然后迈克尔在他耳边低语了些什么。

890
00:36:07.240 --> 00:36:08.180
And you're like...
你当时就……

891
00:36:08.180 --> 00:36:08.920
I remember this, yeah.
我记得这个，没错。

892
00:36:08.940 --> 00:36:10.320
You're like, what did he say?
你当时想，他说了什么？

893
00:36:10.320 --> 00:36:14.940
And Ken's like, he told me not to say, but he has a gun.
肯说，他不让我说，但他有枪。

894
00:36:15.460 --> 00:36:15.980
You know?
你知道吗？

895
00:36:16.480 --> 00:36:17.820
That was scripted, right?
那是剧本写的，对吧？

896
00:36:17.820 --> 00:36:18.700
Yeah, that was scripted.
对，那是剧本写的。

897
00:36:18.780 --> 00:36:23.060
But I could see people just in the background, just like, and how ridiculous it was.
但我能看到背景里的人，他们觉得这太荒谬了。

898
00:36:24.520 --> 00:36:28.540
I can't believe that was a real thing, that someone in a class did that.
我真不敢相信那是真的，竟然有人在即兴表演课上那样做。

899
00:36:28.680 --> 00:36:32.560
Because everybody has seen that person in an improv class that doesn't play along.
因为每个人都见过即兴表演课上那种不配合的人。

900
00:36:32.680 --> 00:36:33.640
They just came over with their own thing.
他们只是自顾自地演自己的。

901
00:36:33.860 --> 00:36:36.120
But I thought that was an absurd version of it.
但我认为那是个荒谬的版本。

902
00:36:36.240 --> 00:36:36.500
Yeah.
是啊。

903
00:36:36.640 --> 00:36:38.420
That the guy brings a gun in every time.
就是那家伙每次都带把枪上台。

904
00:36:38.540 --> 00:36:38.660
Yeah.
没错。

905
00:36:38.660 --> 00:36:39.640
And that was a real person.
而且那是真实存在的人。

906
00:36:39.640 --> 00:36:43.560
He just wanted to be the only person left on stage, just so he could do his own bits.
他只是想成为台上唯一的人，好让他能自顾自地表演。

907
00:36:43.560 --> 00:36:44.140
Right, right.
对，对。

908
00:36:44.280 --> 00:36:45.780
But I shared this before.
但我之前分享过这个。

909
00:36:46.060 --> 00:36:52.420
There was a guy, I was on a Herald team one time, and it didn't matter what you said as
有次我在一个Herald剧团，不管你第一句台词说什么，

910
00:36:52.420 --> 00:36:53.100
the first line.
都没用。

911
00:36:53.100 --> 00:36:54.680
He never yes-ended it.
他从来不接戏。

912
00:36:54.820 --> 00:36:59.200
So you could be like, welcome to, you know, Chris's coffee shop.
所以你可能会说，欢迎光临，你知道的，克里斯的咖啡店。

913
00:36:59.560 --> 00:37:01.480
I've got a selection of muffins here.
我这儿有各种松饼。

914
00:37:01.600 --> 00:37:04.360
And he would say, how dare you do that to my cat?
然后他会说，你怎么敢对我猫做那种事？

915
00:37:05.220 --> 00:37:08.360
Like, wait, we're at a muffin shop.
就像是，等等，我们在松饼店啊。

916
00:37:08.360 --> 00:37:09.680
Like, you didn't even hear it.
就好像，你根本没听见一样。

917
00:37:09.860 --> 00:37:10.320
Yeah, yeah.
是啊，是啊。

918
00:37:10.320 --> 00:37:11.980
And I'm like, I'm sorry about your cat.
然后我说，我很抱歉你的猫出了事。

919
00:37:12.160 --> 00:37:15.020
And then he would be like, I'm a detective.
接着他会说，我是个侦探。

920
00:37:15.360 --> 00:37:16.220
And you're like, what?
你就会想，什么鬼？

921
00:37:16.460 --> 00:37:18.620
It just would get weirder and weirder.
事情只会变得越来越离谱。

922
00:37:18.980 --> 00:37:23.260
And then he'd be like, you're no longer my cousin.
然后他会说，你不再是我的表亲了。

923
00:37:23.520 --> 00:37:23.700
What?
什么？

924
00:37:23.920 --> 00:37:24.760
It's just like, anyway.
总之就是这样。

925
00:37:25.300 --> 00:37:26.920
But what we all collectively—
但我们大家共同——

926
00:37:26.920 --> 00:37:27.220
Did he get better?
他有变好吗？

927
00:37:27.480 --> 00:37:29.240
Did he improve his improv?
他的即兴表演有进步吗？

928
00:37:29.240 --> 00:37:31.800
He always came in with his own script.
他总是带着自己的剧本上场。

929
00:37:32.080 --> 00:37:35.340
My favorite thing is when a scene would have been going for a while.
我最喜欢的是当一场戏已经演了一会儿之后。

930
00:37:35.500 --> 00:37:39.300
So let's say we're two nurses on our break, right?
假设我们是两个正在休息的护士，对吧？

931
00:37:39.420 --> 00:37:40.360
And we're having lunch.
我们正在吃午饭。

932
00:37:40.740 --> 00:37:43.860
And the scene is about two nurses in a hospital.
场景是关于医院里的两个护士。

933
00:37:43.860 --> 00:37:45.580
It's been going for a few minutes.
已经演了几分钟了。

934
00:37:45.780 --> 00:37:46.100
Right, right.
对，对。

935
00:37:46.100 --> 00:37:49.800
And he would come in and be like, hey, where's your clown mask?
然后他会冲进来，说，嘿，你们的小丑面具呢？

936
00:37:49.920 --> 00:37:51.400
You're late for the clown show.
你们小丑表演迟到了。

937
00:37:51.600 --> 00:37:53.000
And we're like, we—what?
我们就会说，我们——什么？

938
00:37:53.580 --> 00:37:55.040
And then you have to integrate it.
然后你不得不把这强行圆进去。

939
00:37:55.160 --> 00:37:56.280
Like, yes, we're—
比如，没错，我们——

940
00:37:56.280 --> 00:37:58.060
We also are clowns.
我们其实也是小丑。

941
00:37:59.180 --> 00:38:00.540
Nursing gets so hard.
护士工作太辛苦了。

942
00:38:00.540 --> 00:38:01.660
We need something fun.
我们需要找点乐子。

943
00:38:01.760 --> 00:38:04.900
After our shift, we do a full clown show.
下班后，我们还要进行一场完整的小丑表演。

944
00:38:05.040 --> 00:38:06.460
There was no teacher to go.
当时没有老师去管。

945
00:38:06.640 --> 00:38:07.080
Yeah.
是啊。

946
00:38:07.200 --> 00:38:07.800
No teacher to say.
没有老师去说。

947
00:38:07.800 --> 00:38:09.980
We would get notes afterwards from our coach.
我们事后会收到教练的反馈。

948
00:38:10.100 --> 00:38:12.760
And they'd be like, once again, they were nurses.
他们会说，再一次，她们本来是护士。

949
