1463
00:55:55.660 --> 00:55:56.580
Celebration of life, right?
生命礼赞，对吧？

1464
00:55:56.860 --> 00:55:57.280
Yes, celebration of life.
没错，生命礼赞。

1465
00:55:57.400 --> 00:55:58.720
