我觉得这应该会很好看，对吧？

1505
00:57:49.050 --> 00:57:51.210
I could totally see that on you.
我完全能想象你弄了之后的样子。

1506
00:57:51.470 --> 00:57:52.730
Always showing off the teeth.
总是喜欢炫耀牙齿。

1507
00:57:53.730 --> 00:57:57.210
There's got to be some way that this could benefit the Neighborhood Watch.
肯定有什么办法能让这事儿对社区巡逻队有好处。

1508
00:57:57.850 --> 00:58:01.770
Oh, we've got lots of ladies that have no upper lip left anymore.
哦，我们这儿有很多女士的上唇都没了。

1509
00:58:02.070 --> 00:58:05.170
You know what happens, how you just get that thin line.
你知道会发生什么，就是那种嘴唇变得很薄的情况。

1510
00:58:05.470 --> 00:58:06.370
It happens.
这很常见。

1511
00:58:06.530 --> 00:58:06.790
It happens.
这很常见。

1512
00:58:06.790 --> 00:58:07.650
It happened to me.
我就遇到过。

1513
00:58:07.910 --> 00:58:08.210
It happens.
这很常见。

1514
00:58:08.630 --> 00:58:11.650
It's hard to take it seriously when you have a thin lip.
嘴唇太薄的话，很难让人认真对待。

1515
00:58:11.930 --> 00:58:14.210
Well, no one can see your teeth, for one.
嗯，首先，别人都看不见你的牙齿。

1516
00:58:15.370 --> 00:58:16.670
So that's awkward.
所以这很尴尬。

1517
00:58:16.870 --> 00:58:19.310
I think there's something about seeing people's teeth.
我觉得看到别人的牙齿很重要。

1518
00:58:19.310 --> 00:58:21.290
It's primal, right?
这是原始本能，对吧？

1519
00:58:21.950 --> 00:58:22.310
Yeah.
是啊。

1520
00:58:22.310 --> 00:58:25.570
You've got to show your teeth or people think something's up with you.
你必须露出牙齿，否则别人会觉得你有什么猫腻。

1521
00:58:25.750 --> 00:58:25.990
Yeah.
是啊。

1522
00:58:26.230 --> 00:58:28.790
And I need to be trusted as head of the Neighborhood Watch.
而且作为社区巡逻队的负责人，我需要获得信任。

1523
00:58:28.950 --> 00:58:33.490
Whether you've got good teeth, bad teeth, or none at all, you've got to be able to see them.
不管你的牙齿是好是坏，还是根本没有，你都得让人能看见它们。

1524
00:58:33.550 --> 00:58:34.090
That's right.
没错。

1525
00:58:34.090 --> 00:58:38.690
But even if it's more gummy, then tooth, still scary.
但就算牙龈比牙齿多，看起来还是很吓人。

1526
00:58:38.710 --> 00:58:40.730
You can't trust a person unless you see their teeth.
除非你能看到一个人的牙齿，否则你无法信任他。

1527
00:58:40.970 --> 00:58:41.690
Thank you, Moss.
谢谢你，莫斯。

1528
00:58:41.750 --> 00:58:42.410
Thank you.
谢谢。

1529
00:58:42.550 --> 00:58:43.810
Do you have a little helium?
你有氦气吗？

1530
00:58:44.030 --> 00:58:46.150
