能帮我们两个姐妹弄点吗？

1531
00:58:46.150 --> 00:58:50.210
It hasn't been approved for human testing yet.
它还没获批进行人体试验呢。

1532
00:58:50.390 --> 00:58:52.590
It's animals, and the animal was dead.
目前只在动物身上试过，而且那只动物还是死的。

1533
00:58:53.110 --> 00:58:53.750
Okay.
好吧。

1534
00:58:54.150 --> 00:58:55.850
We cut to a doctor's office.
场景切换到医生办公室。

1535
00:58:56.730 --> 00:59:04.630
I said I just wanted helium in my upper lip, and now I can't eat or swallow anything.
我说我只是想在上唇里打点氦气，结果现在我什么都吃不下，也咽不下。

1536
00:59:05.890 --> 00:59:12.910
Well, ma'am, what possessed you to think that helium should be injected directly into your lips?
女士，到底是什么让你觉得氦气应该直接注射到嘴唇里？

1537
00:59:12.910 --> 00:59:16.610
Now, that just sounds like an accident waiting to happen.
这听起来就像是一场迟早会发生的事故。

1538
00:59:17.330 --> 00:59:29.290
When you say it out loud like that, it doesn't sound so smart, but I was at this celebration of life for an alligator, and there was this very beautiful man named Miles,
当你大声说出来的时候，听起来确实不太明智，但我当时在参加一场鳄鱼的生命庆典，有个叫迈尔斯的帅哥，

1539
00:59:29.430 --> 00:59:32.430
and he told me that helium in my lips could show my teeth.
他告诉我嘴唇里打氦气能让我露出牙齿。

1540
00:59:32.810 --> 00:59:40.010
Well, ma'am, listen, we're going to get you some kind of treatment, but we have different tiers of treatment,
好吧，女士，听着，我们会为你提供某种治疗，但我们有不同等级的治疗方案，

