1542
00:59:43.210 --> 00:59:46.170
Doctor, I have the paperwork right here.
医生，文件我都在这儿呢。

1543
00:59:46.310 --> 00:59:46.690
Oh, wonderful.
哦，太好了。

1544
00:59:46.970 --> 00:59:48.150
Credit score and everything.
信用评分什么的都有。

1545
00:59:48.370 --> 00:59:48.910
Credit score.
信用评分。

1546
00:59:49.190 --> 00:59:49.310
Oh, Lord.
天哪。

1547
00:59:49.430 --> 00:59:50.210
Credit score?
信用评分？

1548
00:59:50.470 --> 00:59:52.370
What does that have to do with my upper lip?
这跟我上唇有什么关系？

1549
00:59:53.230 --> 00:59:55.090
Oh, what is that?
哦，那是什么？

1550
00:59:55.290 --> 00:59:55.990
A four?
四分？

1551
00:59:56.610 --> 00:59:57.410
A thirty?
三十岁？

1552
00:59:57.730 --> 00:59:58.370
My goodness.
我的天呐。

1553
00:59:59.490 --> 01:00:01.670
There's a shelf over there.
那边有个架子。

1554
01:00:01.830 --> 01:00:03.290
Well, if you just go look at that shelf.
嗯，如果你去看看那个架子的话。

1555
01:00:03.310 --> 01:00:04.290
