那只是一堆生锈的手术刀。

1558
01:00:08.330 --> 01:00:08.790
Yes.
是的。

1559
01:00:09.050 --> 01:00:09.350
Oh.
噢。

1560
01:00:10.130 --> 01:00:12.910
We're going to be able to just poke a little hole in there,
我们只需要在那儿戳个小洞，

1561
01:00:12.910 --> 01:00:17.210
and then there's, I think there's a bottle of alcohol or peroxide down there.
然后我想下面应该有一瓶酒精或过氧化氢。

1562
01:00:17.330 --> 01:00:18.530
That should clean everything up.
那应该能把一切清理干净。

1563
01:00:18.650 --> 01:00:19.730
That's all we can do for you.
我们能为你做的也就这些了。

1564
01:00:20.750 --> 01:00:22.970
But thank you so much.
但还是非常感谢你。

1565
01:00:24.810 --> 01:00:25.730
Tell a friend.
告诉你的朋友们吧。

1566
01:00:26.090 --> 01:00:27.170
Going to get a scalpel.
去拿把手术刀。

1567
01:00:27.370 --> 01:00:32.230
We cut Michelle to a more of a holistic doctor's office.
我们把米歇尔带到了一家更偏向全科的诊所。

1568
01:00:32.930 --> 01:00:39.470
Michelle, I just want to say I'm so sorry for what you experienced at the regular doctor's office the other day,
米歇尔，我只想说，对于你前几天在正规医生诊所的遭遇，我感到非常抱歉，

1569
01:00:39.690 --> 01:00:40.910
trying to fix your ailment.
他们试图治好你的病。

1570
01:00:40.910 --> 01:00:44.230
So, so, so, so, so much.
真的非常、非常、非常、非常、非常抱歉。

1571
01:00:44.410 --> 01:00:46.950
You're absolutely so welcome.
不用客气，绝对不用客气。

1572
01:00:47.590 --> 01:00:56.730
I just want you to know that we also are ready to help you and treat you here at Holly's Holistic office.
我只是想让你知道，我们这里也随时准备在霍莉全科诊所为你提供帮助和治疗。

1573
01:00:57.150 --> 01:00:59.170
How long do I have to hold the crystal?
我需要拿这个水晶多久？

1574
01:00:59.770 --> 01:01:03.170
You're going to have to hold the crystal for about two weeks.
你需要拿这个水晶大约两周时间。

1575
01:01:03.290 --> 01:01:04.190
Yes, yes.
是的，是的。

1576
01:01:04.190 --> 01:01:09.110
And that crystal you have there, you'll see it's sort of like an amethySt.
你手里的那块水晶，你会发现它有点像紫水晶。

1577
01:01:09.630 --> 01:01:11.270
I hope I'm pronouncing that right.
希望我没读错。

1578
01:01:11.970 --> 01:01:16.510
That is based on a police report and a credit check that we ran on you.
这是根据我们对你进行的警方报告和信用调查得出的结果。

1579
01:01:16.510 --> 01:01:17.050
Seriously?
认真的吗？

1580
01:01:17.390 --> 01:01:17.870
Yes.
是的。

1581
01:01:18.450 --> 01:01:18.950
Amethyst?
紫水晶？

1582
01:01:18.950 --> 01:01:26.610
Yeah, it's, it's, if not that, we would have given you, oh, just such a big, beautiful crystal with other properties.
是啊，如果不是这个的话，我们本会给你一块又大又漂亮、拥有其他特性的水晶的。

1583
01:01:26.790 --> 01:01:30.830
But this is, unfortunately, all we were able to provide for you today.
但很遗憾，这就是我们今天能为你提供的全部了。

1584
01:01:31.270 --> 01:01:31.410
Yeah.
好吧。

1585
01:01:31.730 --> 01:01:32.190
I understand.
我明白了。

1586
01:01:32.850 --> 01:01:33.970
Thank you so much.
非常感谢。

1587
01:01:34.170 --> 01:01:35.170
You're so welcome.
不用客气。

1588
01:01:35.170 --> 01:01:40.830
Normally, this goes over so poorly with our clients, but I'm just so pleased at your positive attitude.
通常情况下，客户对这个结果会非常不满，但我对你积极的态度感到非常高兴。

1589
01:01:40.950 --> 01:01:45.490
And I feel like this is the sort of thing I would love to have from most of our clients here.
我觉得这正是我们希望从大多数客户那里得到的东西。

1590
01:01:45.570 --> 01:01:48.430
There's this lovely attitude, this vibe that you're bringing in.
你带来了一种可爱的态度，一种氛围。

1591
01:01:48.550 --> 01:01:51.710
I just appreciate that you gave me some water because I was so thirsty.
我很感激你给了我一些水，因为我太渴了。

1592
01:01:52.610 --> 01:01:54.830
Water is definitely not in your tier.
水绝对不在你的等级范围内。

1593
01:01:55.010 --> 01:01:56.130
I am so sorry.
非常抱歉。

1594
01:01:56.410 --> 01:02:01.050
Just consider yourself lucky because, you know, water, what is it anyway?
你就当自己走运吧，毕竟，你知道，水到底是什么呢？

1595
01:02:01.730 --> 01:02:04.610
I'm looking at my assistant here to see if they can tell me.
我正在看我的助手，看他们能不能告诉我。

1596
01:02:04.610 --> 01:02:07.090
I'm just here to spread good vibes.
我在这里只是为了传播良好的氛围。

1597
01:02:07.310 --> 01:02:09.350
That's all I'm doing over here.
我在这里做的仅此而已。

1598
01:02:09.670 --> 01:02:11.570
And the vibes are right, so.
而且氛围很对，所以。

1599
01:02:11.890 --> 01:02:12.850
I'm just so thirsty.
我真的太渴了。

1600
01:02:13.430 --> 01:02:15.690
If we didn't have anything, I can take a sip of.
如果我们什么都没有的话，我能喝上一口吗。

1601
01:02:15.870 --> 01:02:22.910
We cut Michelle to a, to a Sunday church service where prayer requests are being given.
镜头切到米歇尔参加的周日礼拜，大家正在提出代祷事项。

1602
01:02:25.560 --> 01:02:27.560
And yeah, I believe you were about to say something.
没错，我想你刚才正要说什么。

1603
01:02:27.720 --> 01:02:28.800
I'm sorry, or should I go ahead?
抱歉，还是我先说？

1604
01:02:29.100 --> 01:02:30.120
No, it's, it's okay.
不，没关系，你说吧。

1605
01:02:30.240 --> 01:02:33.900
We have, we have two pastors at this church and we can, we can share it.
我们教会里有两位牧师，我们可以分担一下。

1606
01:02:33.980 --> 01:02:35.080
We can share the love.
我们可以分享这份爱。

1607
01:02:35.420 --> 01:02:35.800
Amen!
阿门！

1608
01:02:36.180 --> 01:02:38.600
Yes, just as our Lord would want us to do.
是的，正如主所愿。

1609
01:02:38.680 --> 01:02:41.400
So please, we'll, we'll, one sentence at a time.
所以请大家一次只说一句。

1610
01:02:41.480 --> 01:02:41.680
Okay?
